# Build context of frontend/Dockerfile (INF-04). The image installs its own
# dependencies with `npm ci` from package-lock.json; without this file
# `COPY . .` copied the host's node_modules on top of them (another platform's
# native binaries, whatever version was installed locally) and the build output.
node_modules
dist
.vite
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.env
.env.*
